  "initialFailures": [
    "Mark delta nodes omitted schema-required duration even though named marks have their own permanent lifetime. Added duration 1 to the two delta nodes; authoritative mark spec remains durationSec -1.",
    "The invisibility assertion used a nonexistent ModifierSource field; changed to the actual vision grant field.",
    "The first runner invocation omitted minWorkers and conflicted with the repository pool minimum. No tests ran; subsequent invocations specify both bounds.",
    "Movement fixtures initially changed nav.order without applying the player intent, leaving moveTarget empty. Replaced with orderSystem and asserted actual displacement. A nearby ally then caused real separation after hold; moved that unrelated body off the test route rather than suppressing collision.",
    "The expected EX refusal enum was incorrectly status-cost; the actual public result is no-resource.",
    "The preview result reports resources at the end of its observation window. Waiting two further seconds naturally accumulated another stack; payment-specific assertion now observes the immediate post-cast tick. Full lifetime is tested separately."
  ],
